@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Import local product pool seed data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/product-pool/import
Content-Type: application/json

< ../../samples/product-pool/seed-products.json

### Product pool stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/product-pool/stats

### Product pool products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/product-pool/products

### Register a demo image asset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assets/images
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "variantType": "compressed_recognition",
  "sourceType": "demo",
  "isPrimaryRecognitionAsset": true
}

### Create session from returned assetId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": "{{assetId}}",
  "entrySource": "test_app",
  "categoryHint": "shoe"
}

### Multi-turn filter examples
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/turns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "500以内，只看京东和得物，只看有货"
}
